Z||000003||PeaceDawg||05-29-2001||10:03 PM||||I have dealt with Lui several times over the last several years and I have never had any problems. I have just bought used parts for my own needs and the prices are reasonable.<BR>He does have a nice selection of Fiero's and a huge selection of parts cars.  If there was ever a problem with a part it was never a problem to exchange. Great for me cuz I live just up the road.<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||6
